tantra2 relative-velocity-expr

-- v_rel = v_observer - v_observed
--
-- the observer chooses the frame. the observed is seen from that frame.
-- v_A wrt B: A is the observer, B is the observed.
-- same dt (shared sthira-apeksha) so time cancels — pure subtraction.

takes observer-velocity
takes observed-velocity

val = sub observer-velocity observed-velocity

return val

done
